    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>九月正值秋招季，想必很多人都像言琦一样，在找工作的路上忐忑奔波</span></p><span></span><p><span>我不免在和母亲的对话中，聊到这一问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>在普通的六零后妈妈眼里，我们年轻人的工作究竟有多少是超出她想象的呢，本期节目将浅聊一下这些内容，看看妈妈对于我们的工作，存在多少理解性误区</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容如下：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a>：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>六零后妈妈工作的年代，社会对职场人有什么要求呢？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">06:19</a>：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>那些妈妈年轻时没有见过的职业</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a>：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>新兴行业究竟是如何兴起的呢</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a>：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>对妈妈而言，新媒体时代的利与弊</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a>：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>妈妈对年轻人工作存在的理解性误区</span></p>]]></description>
