    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f153f63fa4090b74d74ee3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Sep 2023 03:01:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期以“恐惧”为主题，探讨了恐惧的本质、面对恐惧时的反应、如何应对因恐惧滋生的焦虑和痛苦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>尽管性格南辕北辙，我和妈妈却或多或少地，都有各自恐惧的事物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>胆大如她，也会因恐惧而慌乱，烦躁，甚至内耗……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>所以，即使是妈妈，也会感到害怕！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>① 恐惧的本质：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>② 妈妈的恐惧：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>③ 我的恐惧：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>④ 妈妈面对恐惧的第一反应：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>⑤ 我面对恐惧的第一反应：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>⑥ 为什么会产生这样的反应：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>⑦ 如何改变：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>⑧ 面对恐惧，我们可以怎么做：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Tokyo-Luna Shadows</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>愿我们都能够不念过往，不惧将来，成为彩色的大人~</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>感谢您的收听，祝您有个美好的周五！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>这里是六零九零砰砰砰，我们下期见~</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
